OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and largely sunny day
OL,6,Fmorning but skies will turn hazy this
OL,7,Fafternoon as some high cloud begins to
OL,8,Fspill in from the northwest. Feeling
OL,9,Fvery warm, especially in the south.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry and warm evening to come
OL,12,Fwith some hazy sunshine. Overnight
OL,13,Fcloud will continue to thicken with
OL,14,Fsome rain arriving into Cumbria.
OL,15,
OL,16,CFriday:FOutbreaks of rain will spread
OL,17,Fsouthwards throughout Friday but
OL,18,Ftending to weaken as it does so. Many
OL,19,Fareas becoming dry during the
OL,20,Fafternoon with sunny spells but
OL,21,Ffeeling cooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
